{
  "environment_type": "travel",
  "environments": [
    "canonical",
    "taskvector",
    "travel"
  ],
  "keep_alive": false,
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "prompt",
      "type": "Prompt",
      "controllable": false,
      "params": {
        "template": "Low-fare flight calendar:\n{low_fare_calendar}\n\n"
      },
      "name": null,
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "name": "data",
          "type": "Any"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "name": "system_prompt",
          "type": "str"
        },
        {
          "name": "user_message",
          "type": "str"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "json2xml",
      "type": "NdcJsonToXml",
      "controllable": false,
      "params": {},
      "name": null,
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "name": "data",
          "type": "JsonValue"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "name": "xml",
          "type": "str"
        },
        {
          "name": "error",
          "type": "str"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inject_request",
      "type": "Inject",
      "controllable": false,
      "params": {},
      "name": null,
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "name": "template",
          "type": "Any"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "name": "data",
          "type": "Any"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "xml2json",
      "type": "NdcXmlToJson",
      "controllable": false,
      "params": {},
      "name": null,
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "name": "data",
          "type": "Any"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "name": "json",
          "type": "JsonValue"
        },
        {
          "name": "error",
          "type": "str"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "NdcAirShoppingRQ",
      "controllable": false,
      "params": {
        "url": "tool.request.url",
        "username": "tool.request.username",
        "password": "tool.request.password",
        "timeout": "tool.request.timeout",
        "retries": "tool.request.retries",
        "retry_delay": "tool.request.retry_delay",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/xml",
          "Accept": "application/xml",
          "PriceTTLMaxHours": "24"
        }
      },
      "name": null,
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "name": "xml_request",
          "type": "str"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "name": "xml_response",
          "type": "str"
        },
        {
          "name": "error",
          "type": "str"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "to_low-fare_cal",
      "type": "PayloadTransform",
      "controllable": true,
      "params": {
        "repeat_for_each": {
          "field": "AirShoppingRS.OffersGroup.AirlineOffers.Offer",
          "merge_key": "offer",
          "output_key": "low_fare_calendar",
          "item_template": {
            "offer_id": "{offer.$.OfferID}",
            "owner": "{offer.$.Owner}",
            "carrier": "{offer.ValidatingCarrier._}",
            "expires_at": "{offer.TimeLimits.OfferExpiration.$.DateTime}",
            "currency": "{offer.TotalPrice.DetailCurrencyPrice.Total.$.Code}",
            "total_price": "{offer.TotalPrice.DetailCurrencyPrice.Total._}",
            "flights": "{offer.FlightsOverview.FlightRef}",
            "offer_item_id": "{offer.OfferItem.0.$.OfferItemID}",
            "service_id": "{offer.OfferItem.0.Service.0.$.ServiceID}",
            "passenger_refs": "{offer.OfferItem.0.Service.0.PassengerRefs._}",
            "flight_refs": "{offer.OfferItem.0.Service.0.FlightRefs._}",
            "fare_components": "{offer.OfferItem.0.FareDetail.0.FareComponent}",
            "base_amount": "{offer.OfferItem.0.TotalPriceDetail.BaseAmount._}"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": null,
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "name": "data",
          "type": "Any"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "name": "parser_output",
          "type": "Any"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    {
      "from": "inject_request",
      "to": "json2xml",
      "from_port": "0",
      "to_port": "0",
      "connection_type": null
    },
    {
      "from": "json2xml",
      "to": "request",
      "from_port": "0",
      "to_port": "0",
      "connection_type": null
    },
    {
      "from": "request",
      "to": "xml2json",
      "from_port": "0",
      "to_port": "0",
      "connection_type": null
    },
    {
      "from": "xml2json",
      "to": "to_low-fare_cal",
      "from_port": "0",
      "to_port": "0",
      "connection_type": null
    },
    {
      "from": "to_low-fare_cal",
      "to": "prompt",
      "from_port": "0",
      "to_port": "0",
      "connection_type": null
    }
  ],
  "code_blocks": [
  ],
  "layout": null,
  "origin": {
    "canonical": true,
    "node_red": null,
    "pyflow": null,
    "n8n": null,
    "ryven": null,
    "comfyui": null
  },
  "origin_format": "dict",
  "runtime": "native",
  "tabs": null,
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Read JSON tool subflow: This workflow extracts content from a JSON file, classifies and gets it formatted into a prompt - str."
  },
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "comment_system_canonical",
      "info": "# Units Interaction\nThis is a native workflow graph (canonical), created in-app or loaded from dict/YAML.\n\nThe units communicate using JSON actions (e.g. { \"action\": \"search\", \"query\": \"...\", \"max_results\": \"10\" }) and its own types for observations (e.g. { \"type\": \"search_result\", \"results\": [...], \"query\": \"...\" }). Data flows over connections from port to port; each port carries one of these structured payloads.\n\n## Standard data flow\n\ninput_port: Data received on that port\noutput_port: Data sent from that port\n\nThe unit's API parameters live in `params`: {...}, which can be set to adjust its behaviour.\n\n## Function / script units\n\nAll the function/script units (\"type\": \"function\" or \"script\") are provided with its source code via the `code_blocks`:\n\n  \"code_blocks\": [\n    { \"id\": \"unit_id\", \"language\": \"python\", \"source\": \"...\" }\n  ]\n\n## Units Library\n\nThe units library is a collection of units for building workflows. Pick up the units form the library while constructing your workflow.\n\n",
      "commenter": "System",
      "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:07:49Z",
      "x": null,
      "y": null
    }
  ],
  "todo_lists": []
}
